)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">Median</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">79.00</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">94.00</td><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">0.580</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">Range</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">44.00–129.00</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">23.00–129.00</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">PLT (×10<sup>9</sup>/L)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">Median</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">51.00</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">24.00</td><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">0.623</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">Range</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">4.00–346.00</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">6.00–402.00</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">RBC (×10<sup>9</sup>/L)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">Median</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">2.25</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">2.63</td><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">0.415</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">Range</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">1.27–4.06</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">1.27–3.85</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">BM Blast (%)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">Median</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">42.00</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">71.75</td><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">0.073</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">Range</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">21.29–93.57</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">22.06–92.14</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">Gene mutation</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">Mutation</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">4 (26.7%)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">6 (40%)</td><td rowspan="2" colspan="1">0.456</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">No mutation</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">11 (73.4%)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1">9 (60%)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p><italic toggle="yes">BM</italic> bone marrow, <italic toggle="yes">HB</italic> hemoglobin, <italic toggle="yes">PLT</italic> platelet and <italic toggle="yes">WBC</italic> white blood cell, <italic toggle="yes">RBC</italic> red blood cell.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></p><p id="Par3">We have carefully corrected this error, and the corrected Table <xref rid="Tab2" ref-type="table">2</xref> is as shown above.</p><p id="Par4">The original article has been corrected.</p></body><back><fn-group><fn><p>The article to which this update relates has been retracted. Please see the retraction notice for more detail: 10.1038/s41417-025-00913-9</p></fn></fn-group></back></article></pmc-articleset>